   "text": "Thank you, Ruth. Your identity is verified.\n\nI found your Big Slice Pizza order (Q-7690) from October 23. Our records show the garlic knots ($6.50) were missing, and an earlier agent promised you a $6.50 account credit for them. That credit was never applied, so I've now added **$6.50 in account credit** to your account. Your balance is $6.50, and you can use it on future orders.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with?"
