   "text": "I understand the difference is disappointing. The record of the earlier conversation shows a promise of $6.50, which is the amount I credited. I can't add the extra $3.50, since I can only issue what was documented.\n\nYour $6.50 credit is on your account now. If you'd like to discuss the $10 you were told about, I can connect you with a human specialist, who will follow up within 24 hours. Is there anything else I can help with?"
